        <outline type="rss" text="为了音乐的聚会" title="为了音乐的聚会" xmlUrl="https://api.vistopia.com.cn/rss/program/236.xml" description="「看理想」App，一个陪你成长的知识剧场。
回溯百年流行音乐流变，它为我们留下了共同的情感记忆与联结，而与之共同成长的时装品牌 GUCCI 也于今年迎来它的百岁生日，当时尚与音乐紧密联结，成为不同世代创作者表达自我的载体，也以多元包容之内涵丰富个性，激发蜕变。
我们邀请不同背景、风格与表演方式的音乐人作客，从古典到放克，从嘻哈到爵士，解构音乐元素与魅力，创想与时尚之间的风格关联。
欢迎下载「看理想」App留言互动。"/>
        <outline type="rss" text="无责任编辑部" title="无责任编辑部" xmlUrl="https://feed.xyzfm.space/qbpb4a3fw3cv" description="《无责任编辑部》是一档就某个商业话题展开无差别扯淡的播客。

它起源于我们编辑部每周一次的选题会，我们想把那些没有写进稿子里的灵光乍现，以及一些不负责任的废话收集起来，于是有了这档播客。

如果你听完节目，想看看我们创作的内容，欢迎在B站、视频号等平台搜索“IC实验室”。"/>
        <outline type="rss" text="All Ears English Podcast" title="All Ears English Podcast" xmlUrl="https://feeds.megaphone.fm/allearsenglish" description="Are you looking for a new and fun way to learn American English? Come hang out with Lindsay and Michelle from Boston and New York City and have fun while you improve your English listening skills! We are an English as a Second Language (ESL) podcast for intermediate to advanced English learners around the world. We will show you how to use everyday English vocabulary and natural idioms, expressions, and phrasal verbs and how to make small talk in American English. We will also give you special tips on American culture, customs, etiquette, and how to speak with Americans as well as conversation and commentary on study tips, business English, life in America and Boston and New York, how to apply to university in the US, dating, travel, food and more. You&amp;apos;ll get TOEFL, IELTS, and TOEIC help also from The Examiner of Excellence, Jessica Beck. This podcast is for adult students who are professionals and university students as well as ESL teachers. Join the community to learn to speak American English like a native! Connection NOT Perfection!"/>
        <outline type="rss" text="必要生活 Being Alive" title="必要生活 Being Alive" xmlUrl="https://feed.xyzfm.space/drlbmmec9wvw" description="必要生活第二季「生活改良方案」持续更新中，每隔双周周三全平台上线。
每一集，我们都会和你一起去探索一个日常生活切面。
追觅洗地机可以帮助你更好地解决居家的清洁问题，这档播客也希望可以给你的生活提供一些新鲜思路，发现让我们生活变更好的改良方案。


本节目由 追觅洗地机 × Marcast 联合呈现。
小红书：@必要生活BeingAlive

如果你有家居清洁的各类需求，也欢迎你在淘宝/天猫搜索「追觅官方旗舰店」，挑选适合你的产品。

小红书：@追觅洗地机
淘宝/天猫：追觅官方旗舰店"/>
