        <outline type="rss" text="HODLong 后浪" title="HODLong 后浪" xmlUrl="https://feeds.simplecast.com/lnmJvIXR" description="Welcome to HODLong 后浪. This is a podcast hosted by Mable Jiang. This is THE ONLY BILINGUAL (EN/CN) PODCAST you need to follow. show attempts to shed light on the broader Web3 community, whether that being operators, investors, or ecosystem participants of other forms. 

欢迎来到HODLong 后浪。双语播客你只需要关注这一个就够了。本节目由Mable Jiang主理，旨在和听众一起探索Web3 社区（项目运营者、投资人、其他生态系统参与者等）。"/>
