        <outline type="rss" text="正在种钱" title="正在种钱" xmlUrl="https://feed.xyzfm.space/78pn8bwfb3u9" description="关注《正在种钱》，你会发现财务自由的门槛并不高。我相信，每个人都可以通过合理规划财务和生活，更富有，更睿智，更快乐，更自由。

也许财务自由并不是有花不完的钱想干嘛干嘛，而是在于有了不做某些事情的自由，比如可以为自己而不是为别人工作，不用为想象中的明天牺牲今天的幸福…

相比于「搞钱」，「种钱」是我们合理规划、自我给予的过程，更有满足感。

《正在种钱》关注用自己的方式，合理规划财务，自由生活的人，分享他们的经历和方法，帮助我们实现工作自由，生活自由，乃至财务自由。"/>
        <outline type="rss" text="51% with Mable Jiang, Presented by Multicoin Capital" title="51% with Mable Jiang, Presented by Multicoin Capital" xmlUrl="https://feeds.simplecast.com/YaYB9tjI" description="Welcome to 51%, a podcast hosted by Mable Jiang that explores blockchain&amp;apos;s rapid development across Asia, with a particular focus on the perspectives, communities and operators based in China. 

This podcast will feature a mix of English and Chinese discussions. The goal is to bring Eastern perspectives to West and Western perspectives to East, so the audience can better understand the crypto&amp;apos;s unique market structure and how these distinct communities think and operate.  

This podcast is proudly  presented by Multicoin Capital."/>
